ability to connect the right people with the right information. WSU Libraries Student Assistant – Access Services WSU Libraries is seeking a student assistant with morning and weekend availability, to provide services offered within Access services, gaining experience in multiple areas of the library, including Circulation, Stacks, and Interlibrary Loan. Student Assistant/Student Adminstrative Assistant The TRIO SSS STEM Program is seeking a detail-oriented and organized student to serve as a Student Administrative Assistant. This position will play an important role in supporting program operations and helping develop administrative processes for a growing federally funded student success program serving STEM majors. This position is ideal for a student interested in organizational leadership, business administration, project management, communications, higher education, nonprofit management, or related fields who would like practical experience supporting program operations and student services. Not sure if Wichita is right for you? Sign up to receive emails from our Talent team to learn more about what it's like working here. First Name (required) cb99f6a8 Last Name (required) 45bcbbd1 Email (required) 45710fdc Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Close Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enabl