    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/kfn-student-assistant-software-engineer-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "KFN Student Assistant Software Engineer",
      "description": "KFN Student Assistant Software Engineer - Wichita, Kansas, United States KFN Student Assistant Software Engineer - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode KFN Student Assistant Software Engineer Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm | Student KFN Student Assistant Software Engineer 497748 Student Department Ennovar Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $14 - 18 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The Ennovar team is looking for a student assistant to work with Kansas Fiber Network as a Software Engineer. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties • Work on projects such as a Service Advisory Tool, MTTR Reporting Tool, and Service Configuration Tool. • Research and develop custom software solutions for each project. • Design user interfaces and APIs for web-based tools. • Create end-user documentation and support materials. • Use CI/CD pipelines and industry-standard development tools. • Collaborate with stakeholders to gather requirements and present deliverables. • Participate in the Agile process and iterative development cycles. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications • Engaged in completing a four-year degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or MIS. • Experience with Python, React, or JavaScript (academic or professional). • Ability to work independently and in a team setting. • Exposure to full-stack development. • Exposure to Circuit Vision ticket tracking software. • Familiarity with automated reporting, dashboard creation, and API integration. • Interest in telecom systems, service availability, and network configuration. • Familiarity with circuit design layouts and router configuration. • Strong communication and organizational skills. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment, including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) df497e4e Last Name (required) c101bfe2 Email (required) 58c4bf9b Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) da4fd666 Last Name (required) 28877f27 Email (required) 5f18685d Job Alert 5074c8cb Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) c7740d19 Last Name (required) b4f1ff07 Email (required) a2dae410 Send This Job To: cf6b8d45 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to rec