    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/niar-cad-cam-engineering-design-checker-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "NIAR CAD/CAM Engineering Design Checker",
      "description": "NIAR CAD/CAM Engineering Design Checker - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR CAD/CAM Engineering Design Checker - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR CAD/CAM Engineering Design Checker NIAR Institute | Temporary NIAR CAD/CAM Engineering Design Checker 495586 Temporary Department NIAR CAD/CAM Lab Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $50 per hour Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Details Independently compares and verifies that 3D models are complete and accurate representations of 2D data packages. Develops and recommends solutions to design problems. Job Duties • Examines engineering drawings and related documents. • Compares 3D models and annotations to the provided 2D documents to ensure quality, accuracy, and completeness. • Provide feedback to the modelers and annotators on any errors or omissions. • Interfaces with modelers and annotators and helps mentor development. Additional Requirements • Ability to read and interpret engineering drawings and specifications • Proficient in reading 2D drawings • Ability to listen effectively, take direction, and possess initiative to accomplish assigned tasks Preferred Qualifications • Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering or related field • 5 years of related experience • Work is completed in-person and onsite in Wichita, KS Physical Requirements Ability to lift and carry up to 25 lbs Apply Now First Name (required) c2a7b543 Last Name (required) cf89e394 Email (required) 67766cfb Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequ