    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/nbe-student-assistant-work-study-0350w-wichita-kansas-united-states-09875358-ded2-45fe-a303-43e34870356e": {
      "title": "NBE Student Assistant - Work Study 0350W",
      "description": "NBE Student Assistant - Work Study 0350W - Wichita, Kansas, United States NBE Student Assistant - Work Study 0350W - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NBE Student Assistant - Work Study 0350W Strategic Enrollment Mgmt | Student NBE Student Assistant - Work Study 0350W 499735 Student Department Rhatigan Student Center Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay 12/hr Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Up to 20 hours per week Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Looking for a fun, fast-paced campus job? Join the team at Shocker Sports Grill & Lanes in the Rhatigan Student Center! As a Guest Server, you'll help create a welcoming and enjoyable experience for WSU students, faculty, staff, and visitors. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Looking for a fast-paced job where no two days are the same? Shocker Sports Grill & Lanes is looking for energetic, customer-focused team members to help create a great experience for our guests. As a Guest Server, you'll be one of the first faces guests see when they visit. You'll help provide outstanding service, maintain a welcoming atmosphere, and support daily operations in a fun and active entertainment environment. The position involves direct interaction with guests, cashiering, stocking supplies, maintaining cleanliness, and helping ensure every guest has an enjoyable experience. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Must be able to provide friendly, professional customer service while interacting with a diverse group of guests. Ability to work in a fast-paced environment and remain calm under pressure. Must be dependable, punctual, and able to work scheduled shifts. Ability to work evenings, weekends, and special events as needed. Must be able to stand and walk for extended periods of time. Ability to lift, carry, and stock supplies weighing up to 25 pounds. Ability to follow established cash handling, food safety, and operational procedures. Must work well both independently and as part of a team. Strong communication, problem-solving, and decision-making skills are required. Commitment to maintaining a clean, safe, and welcoming environment for guests. Based on the position description, the role requires excellent verbal communication, teamwork, independent work, sound judgment, and a strong customer service focus. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Preferred Qualifications Previous customer service, hospitality, restaurant, retail, or recreation experience. Experience handling cash transactions and operating a point-of-sale (POS) system. Ability to provide exceptional guest service in a fast-paced environment. Strong interpersonal and communication skills. Experience working as part of a team while maintaining individual responsibilities. Demonstrated ability to anticipate guest needs and resolve concerns professionally. Ability to multitask and prioritize responsibilities in a busy setting. Flexible availability, including evenings, weekends, and special events. Interest in hospitality, customer service, food service, recreation, or event operations. Additional Information Shocker Sports Grill & Lanes is committed to creating a fun, welcoming, and customer-focused environment for both guests and employees. This position offers an opportunity to gain valuable experience in hospitality, customer service, cash handling, and team collaboration while working in one of Wichita State University's premier entertainment venues. Successful candidates will be enthusiastic, dependable, and committed to providing exceptional service to every guest. The position requires direct interaction with guests and supporting daily operations in a fast-paced environment. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 9d0161db Last Name (required) 22ec4640 Email (required) ff8b0f8c Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 5401fcfe Last Name (required) 4b67e604 Email (required) bcb431d7 Job Alert 560b253e Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Strategic Enrollment Mgmt Strategic Enrollment Mgmt Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) dbe097ed Last Name (required) c3f39362 Email (required) f5193136 Send This Job To: cc104057 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not Y