      "title": "NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant",
      "description": "NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant NIAR Institute | Student NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant 499661 Student Department NIAR Full-Scale Structural Test Campus Location Other Kansas Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $12 - 18 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The NIAR Full Scale Structural Test lab is looking for a Facilities Student Assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Assist the NIAR Full Scale staff with a variety of assignments critical to tasks in support of customer projects. Tasking may include meeting support, front desk management, mailroom, freight shipping, facility maintenance tasks, escort of vendors. Tasks may include general business operations tasks if qualified and experienced. Assist Full Scale shop staff with test setup build and facility maintenance. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements The work is 100% on site at the NIAR ASTEC Coliseum facility in Park City KS. Additional Information Mix of shop and office tasks, in conditioned and unconditioned spaces. Applicant should be able to lift and safely climb in and out of test fixtures. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 167718b3 Last Name (required) feb2ae12 Email (required) 95a5457c Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 286df079 Last Name (required) 99492893 Email (required) 7fe18d43 Job Alert 9fb44a13 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 471aa978 Last Name (required) 29c216b9 Email (required) 960b5737 Send This Job To: 08846fbd Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Polic