      "title": "AE Student Assistant - Work Study",
      "description": "AE Student Assistant - Work Study - Wichita, Kansas, United States AE Student Assistant - Work Study - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode AE Student Assistant - Work Study College of Engineering | Student AE Student Assistant - Work Study 499543 Student Department Aerospace Engineering Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay 15/hr Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. TBD with supervisor Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The Aerospace Engineering Department is seeking a reliable and professional Work-Study Student Assistant to provide front office support and assist with daily administrative operations. This role serves as a key point of contact for visitors, students, faculty, and staff. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties • Answer and direct incoming phone calls in a courteous and professional manner • Warmly welcome and assist visitors; check in guests and notify appropriate staff of arrivals • Respond to general inquiries and provide basic information about the college • Sort and distribute incoming mail to faculty and staff • Monitor and restock office supplies as needed • Help maintain a clean, organized, and welcoming office environment • Provide administrative support and assist with special projects as assigned Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements * MUST be enrolled at Wichita state University* • Must be eligible for Federal Work-Study • Minimum GPA of 2.5 • Availability to work 10–30 hours per week between Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–5:00 PM • Strong communication and customer service sk