    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/student-assistant-at-wsu-old-town-fws-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS",
      "description": "Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS - Wichita, Kansas, United States Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS Academic Programs | Student Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS 499166 Student Department WSU Old Town Satellite Campus Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Old Town Hire Type Part Time Pay $10.00 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Must be able to work evening hours. Depends on class schedules. Office hours are 7am-10pm depending on classes in the building. Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Student assistant will assist students and staff by providing support in operation of the Old Town Administrative Offices. You will serve as the first point of contact for the Old Town Campus by welcoming visitors and providing courteous, professional customer service. Shifts may vary based on building needs and students' schedule. May include evening work schedule. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Answer and direct phone calls, assisting with parking, respond to general inquiries, and assist with front desk coverage. Provide general support to students and staff, including the satellite administrative team. Serves as a resource for troubleshooting technology systems issues. Monitor and maintain office supplies and inventory. General office support: including office projects, copying, assistance with building tours, light cleaning and stocking, and other projects as needed by staff. Contribute to a positive, welcoming office environment and provide excellent service to students, families, faculty, and staff. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Must be eligible for Federal Work Study program. Must have dependable transportation as position is not on main campus. This position is not eligible for sponsorship. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) c0656460 Last Name (required) 1cd1245f Email (required) 13c517df Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) fa1f8009 Last Name (required) 890b6d86 Email (required) 8ac16997 Job Alert 8b97132e Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Academic Programs Academic Programs Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With S