      "description": "NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant - Slitter - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant - Slitter - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant - Slitter NIAR Institute | Student NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant - Slitter 496732 Student Department NIAR Advanced Technologies Lab Aerospace Systems Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The NAIR ATLAS Lab is looking for a student assistant to help with a variety of tasks within their lab. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Work in a materials lab focusing on slitting processes for thermoplastic and thermoset materials. You will assist in slitting operations, learn the necessary technical skills, and become familiar with key industry standards for material slitting. Comply with AS9100 and contamination-controlled area (CCA) requirements. Use hand and power tools when needed and cross-train in other areas if the workload requires it. Forklift and respirator certification will be required to work within the area. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) f16abfcf Last Name (required) 2a52f78e Email (required) aad61f92 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related