tions Strong management and organizational skills Excellent customer service, written and verbal skills Team player and welcoming attitude Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 49fabf07 Last Name (required) a2d58ea5 Email (required) a97c0093 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 7fdc58c8 Last Name (required) dddfef6c Email (required) 1127e754 Job Alert 9ce5bfcc Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Strategic Enrollment Strategic Enrollment Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) a7234ee3 Last Name (required) 09f14af1 Email (required) d2662bd0 Send This Job To: 46b8d881 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text