    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/niar-cad-cam-business-analytics-student-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant",
      "description": "NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant NIAR Institute | Student NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant 499312 Student Department NIAR CAD/CAM Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 per hour Work Schedule . Based on class schedule; work is performed on-site and in person. Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The NIAR CAD/CAM lab is looking for a Business Analytics student assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Provide daily administrative and operational support to the Project Manager and program management team. This role focuses on executing routine tasks, maintaining project records, and coordinating logistics to ensure smooth project operations under the direction of project leadership. Essential Functions Project Support: Assists the Project Manager in tracking task timelines, action items, and upcoming milestone deadlines. Documentation & Records: Prepares and distributes meeting agendas, takes detailed meeting minutes, and organizes digital project files and documentation. Administrative Logistics: Coordinates team calendars, schedules meetings, and processes travel authorizations, expense reports, or purchasing requests. Data Entry & Tracking: Enters and updates project tracking data, task updates, and spreadsheet metrics as directed by the team. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications Excellent oral and written communication skills. Proficient with Microsoft Office Products. Have great attention to detail. Ability to lift and carry up to 30 lbs. Able to work 20+ hours per week. Ability to work independently on extensive task. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 23c54726 Last Name (required) 3aa58172 Email (required) f3774f66 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 76ba2494 Last Name (required) a9883900 Email (required) ab4cde4f Job Alert 12638b97 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 4e79a746 Last Name (required) 1b3405cf Email (required) 146b5dda Send This Job To: 69f3bb2e Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive t