    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/student-assistant-lifeguard-wichita-kansas-united-states-9eca574c-812d-4a9b-95d4-ab2e8509df0d": {
      "title": "Student Assistant Lifeguard",
      "description": "Student Assistant Lifeguard - Wichita, Kansas, United States Student Assistant Lifeguard - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Student Assistant Lifeguard Student Affairs (College) | Student Student Assistant Lifeguard 499393 Student Department Student Assistant Lifeguard Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay 10.50/hr Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Flexible based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Lifeguards are responsible for ensuring patron safety by monitoring aquatic areas, enforcing facility rules, and preventing accidents. Primary duties include scanning water for distressed swimmers, performing rescues, administering CPR/first aid, and maintaining safety equipment, alongside assisting with water chemistry checks and cleaning. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Surveillance & Prevention: Actively scanning swimming areas to identify potential hazards or danger, preventing accidents before they occur. Emergency Response: Responding immediately to rescues, which may include assisting distressed swimmers or providing water rescue, artificial respiration, and CPR. Rule Enforcement: Enforcing safety regulations, facility policies, and water safety rules to patrons in a professional manner. Facility Maintenance: Inspecting pool equipment, testing chemical levels (pH/chlorine), and cleaning the pool or beach area. Communication: Reporting to supervisors regarding safety concerns, maintaining accurate accident reports, and working with other staff to ensure a safe environment. Record Keeping: Completing logs on water tests, attendance, and incident/accident reports. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Preferred Qualifications ARC Lifeguard certification, Ellis Lifeguard certification, YMCA Lifeguard certification REQUIRED Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) cc7e393f Last Name (required) ef288ddf Email (required) 5f81b809 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 9c371b25 Last Name (required) 8f9e439a Email (required) e3cc0655 Job Alert 4281a693 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Student Affairs (College) Student Affairs (College) Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (requ