    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/omer-gra-position-wichita-kansas-united-states-67e1d471-980d-4d1a-aaf8-a1aa27eede27": {
      "title": "OMER GRA Position",
      "description": "OMER GRA Position - Wichita, Kansas, United States OMER GRA Position - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode OMER GRA Position Barton School of Business | Student OMER GRA Position 499902 Student Department FREDS Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $3840 per semester Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Dependent upon applicant's class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story This position will work mainly with Dr. Sue Abdinnour in the FREDS department in the Barton School of Business. Job Summary The primary function of a graduate research assistant (GRA) is to assist faculty members in their scholarly and / or creative activities. Job Duties Activities to include coding complex programs in Python, data analysis, doing literature reviews, and help with various research projects Required Education Bachelor's Degree Additional Requirements 1. Excellent knowledge of advanced Excel skills including use of Add-Ins 2. Excellent knowledge of complex Python programming and SOL Database 3. Excellent knowledge of Machine learning algorithms and AI Prompting 4. Strong interpersonal, written and communication skills 5. Strong conceptual, analytical and problem-solving skills 6. Professional, quick learner, and has attention to details Required Experience To be eligible for an assistantship, students must be admitted to a degree program in either full or conditional standing. Students admitted on probation or placed on academic probation following admission may be eligible for assistantship awards under certain circumstances. Preferred Qualifications • Worked for at least 1 year after Bachelor's degree • Expected graduation is December 2027 or later • Spent at least 1 semester at graduate level at WSU with CGPA>=3.6 • Has a record of research publications or writing samples • Has complete applied projects that are available online If you qualify, send your CV, cover letter, and WSU transcript so far (copy is good) to sue.abdinnour@wichita.edu Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 49711b4f Last Name (required) 5d1cfb42 Email (required) 493973d5 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 5983c474 Last Name (required) 04662f9b Email (required) 7015548c Job Alert 056af5bf Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Barton School of Business Barton School of Business Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 5b119263 Last Name (required) b8c0b2ff Email (required) 8e9b4072 Send This Job To: 3d232081 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available j