a campaigns, producing photo and video content, designing promotional materials, writing news stories, email communications, and other marketing content, editing and designing website content, and helping grow the college's brand. This hands-on role is ideal for a creative graduate student with strong writing, content creation, graphic design, and digital communication skills who wants to build an impressive marketing portfolio while making a meaningful impact on student engagement and recruitment for the College of Education. College Access Mentor - Wichita Kansas Kids @ GEAR UP is a state-wide program serving students in foster care, grades 7-12 and first year in college. This is NOT a remote position - check the job location before applying! Executive Assistant to the President's Office The President's Office is seeking a discerning, astute & industrious person to handle the dynamics this position presents. Someone who can bring order to a fast-moving environment without slowing it down. We need exceptionally organized professional who understands that supporting university leadership takes more than managing a calendar. It takes anticipation, sound judgment, discretion, and the ability to see how all the moving pieces fit together. Not sure if Wichita is right for you? Sign up to receive emails from our Talent team to learn more about what it's like working here. First Name (required) d94dfbe7 Last Name (required) 0775e933 Email (required) 6e318169 Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Close Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us 