    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/wsu-general-student-ticketing-development-staff-wichita-kansas-united-states-df29368d-d908-4b0a-b56e-d01bafa3c4a4": {
      "title": "WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff",
      "description": "WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff - Wichita, Kansas, United States WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff Administrative and Support | Athletics, Student WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff 498707 Athletics Student Department Wichita State Intercollegiate Athletic Association Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $10/hour Work Schedule M-F, Flexibility to work evenings, weekends, & holidays. Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Wichita State athletics is searching for professional, service-focused individuals for our ticketing/development team. We deliver memorable experiences that connect all to Shocker Nation through a shared sense of pride and passion. Ticketing/development staff is responsible for providing high-level customer service to WSU Athletics stakeholders while executing day-to-day functions of intercollegiate athletics revenue generation practices. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Make outbound phone calls and handle inbound phone calls, as necessary. Work external events to include all WSU ticketed home events and select hosted events at WSU. Handle conversations in person and over the phone with donors and season ticket holders during office hours. Projects as assigned by Revenue Generation Leadership Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Ability to work nights and weekends. Ability to stay in one position for long periods of time. Be responsible and organized with time. Ability to handle cash and balance. Ability to handle difficult conversations and situations when necessary. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Preferred Qualifications Previous experience in a Sales and Customer Service Environment. Additional Information Students will carry out administrative and technical tasks as it relates to functions of athletics ticketing and development. This includes but is not limited to customer service conversations, interacting with and problem-solving for stakeholders at WSU Athletics events, and maintaining a first-class experience for all WSU patrons. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Frequent 60-90% Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Frequent 60-90% Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Frequent 60-90% Apply Now First Name (required) 4afb16b3 Last Name (required) 515160bb Email (required) af48ee9e Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 4061599a Last Name (required) 65af44bd Email (required) d20c5db5 Job Alert bc6d3043 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Athletics Student Athletics Student Department(s) Administrative and Support Administrative and Support Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this 