      "title": "IDP Research Office Student Assistant",
      "description": "IDP Research Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States IDP Research Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode IDP Research Office Student Assistant Office Ind & Defense Administration | Student IDP Research Office Student Assistant 496121 Student Department Industry & Defense Research Office Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $12 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The Industry & Defense Research Office is looking for a student assistant to help with front office operations. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Front Office Assistance including managing inbox for IDP Contracts and Grants; greeting visitors, ordering office supplies Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications Knowledge of Microsoft products, outlook, and good communication skills Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Not the right fit? Search all jobs here. Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Recommended Jobs OMER GRA Position This position will work mainly with Dr. Sue Abdinnour in the FREDS department in the Barton School of Business. Marketing & Communications Graduate Assistant Are you passionate abou